            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A group of neurotransmitters and neuromodulators that contain one amino group that is connected to an aromatic ring by ethylene group  (‒CH&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;‒CH&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;‒). Monoamines are derived from the aromatic amino acids phenylalanine, tyrosine, histidine and tryptophan.</obo:IAO_0000115>
