        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of pyrazoles that is 1&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;-pyrazole which is substituted at positions 1, 3 and 5 by 4-sulfamoylphenyl, trifluoromethyl and &lt;em&gt;p&lt;/em&gt;-tolyl groups, respectively. A cyclooxygenase-2 inhibitor, it is used in the treatment of arthritis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
