        <obo:IAO_0000115>An EC 2.5.1.* (non-methyl-alkyl or aryl transferase) inhibitor that interferes with the action of dimethylallyl&lt;i&gt;trans&lt;/i&gt;transferase (EC 2.5.1.1).</obo:IAO_0000115>
