        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_70781"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An agent which overcomes insulin resistance by activation of the peroxisome proliferator activated receptor gamma (PPAR-gamma).</obo:IAO_0000115>
