        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_51371"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A drug that suppresses spasms. These are usually caused by smooth muscle contraction, especially in tubular organs. The effect is to prevent spasms of the stomach, intestine or urinary bladder.</obo:IAO_0000115>
