        <obo:IAO_0000115>A &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-α-amino acid anion which is the conjugate base of &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-dopa, obtained by deprotonation of the carboxy group: major species at pH 7.3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>chebi_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>CHEBI:67012</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>L-dopa(1-)</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


