        <obo:IAO_0000115>A ligase inhibitor that interferes with the action of a &lt;em&gt;C&lt;/em&gt;‒&lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt; bond-forming ligase (EC 6.3.*.*).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>chebi_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>CHEBI:75600</oboInOwl:id>
