        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_25212"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any  metabolite produced during a metabolic reaction in eukaryotes, the taxon that include members of the fungi, plantae and animalia kingdoms.</obo:IAO_0000115>
