        <obo:IAO_0000115>A urea in which one of the hydrogens attached to a nitrogen of the urea group is replaced by a sulfonyl group. The &lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt;-sulfonylurea moiety is a key group in various herbicides, as well as in a number of antidiabetic drugs used in the management of type 2 diabetis mellitus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
