            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A semisynthetic opioid of formula C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;18&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;H&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;21&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;NO&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; that is derived from thebaine.  It is a moderately potent opioid analgesic, generally used for relief of moderate to severe pain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
