        <owl:annotatedTarget>Sulfatases, which cleave sulfate esters in biological systems, play a key role in regulating the sulfation states that determine the function of many physiological molecules.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:15493058</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
