        <owl:annotatedTarget>Bacterial 20beta-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase (20beta-HSDH) is a NADH-dependent oxidoreductase belonging to the SDR family and is expressed by some strains of B. adolescentis and it regulates cortisol side-chain cleavage by reducing the C-20 carboxyl group on cortisol, yielding 20beta-dihydrocortisol.</owl:annotatedTarget>
