        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A self-resistance mechanism is encoded within the biosynthetic gene cluster (BGC) for acarbose (acb) production; a specific kinase, AcbK, phosphorylates acarbose at the O6A hydroxyl and renders it inactive.</obo:IAO_0000115>
